  "description": "Argon2id, Argon2i and Argon2d (RFC 9106) in managed C#, with AVX-512, AVX2, NEON and SVE2 compression chosen at run time and no native library. PHC strings with bounded verification and NeedsRehash, secret and associated data, any tag length, and a reusable hasher that keeps its memory and lane threads between calls. Targets .NET 10, .NET 8 and .NET Standard 2.0.",
